1
00:00:02,576 --> 00:00:08,876
== sync, corrected by elderman ==
@elder_man

2
00:00:08,887 --> 00:00:11,887
(Sheldon:)Yeah-- there's hooks in the
closet, I can hang it right now.

3
00:00:11,890 --> 00:00:13,720
(Penny:)Oh, no, no,
Th-those hooks are gone.

4
00:00:13,725 --> 00:00:14,955
(Sheldon:)What happened to them?

5
00:00:14,960 --> 00:00:16,990
(Penny:)Uh, we ran out of candy
on Halloween,

6
00:00:16,995 --> 00:00:19,695
(Penny:)I was just giving
everything away.

7
00:00:20,532 --> 00:00:22,202
Hey, guys, what are you...?

8
00:00:22,201 --> 00:00:24,431
(Leonard:)Oh, that's here, cool.

9
00:00:24,436 --> 00:00:27,206
(Penny:)Amy wants me to have it.

10
00:00:27,206 --> 00:00:28,876
(Amy:)Well, it would be selfish
of me to keep it.

11
00:00:28,874 --> 00:00:30,704
B-But it's a picture of you.

12
00:00:30,709 --> 00:00:32,509
(Amy:)And you.

13
00:00:32,511 --> 00:00:34,611
(Penny:)But you commissioned it.

14
00:00:34,613 --> 00:00:36,783
(Amy:)To give to you.

15
00:00:36,782 --> 00:00:39,052
(Penny:)But you like it so much.

16
00:00:39,051 --> 00:00:41,021
(Amy:)So do you.

17
00:00:42,054 --> 00:00:43,724
(Penny:)I seem to be losing.

18
00:00:43,722 --> 00:00:46,352
(Leonard:)Yes, you do.

19
00:00:46,358 --> 00:00:48,128
(Sheldon:)You know, Leonard,
the more I think about it,

20
00:00:48,127 --> 00:00:50,797
(Sheldon:)there are a number of mutually
owned items in this apartment

21
00:00:50,796 --> 00:00:52,266
(Sheldon:)that you and I
should go through.

22
00:00:52,264 --> 00:00:53,564
(Sheldon:)Uh, for example...

23
00:00:54,566 --> 00:00:56,896
(Sheldon:)who gets our beloved sword,
Longclaw?

24
00:00:56,902 --> 00:00:57,902
(Penny:)Why don't you keep it?

25
00:00:57,903 --> 00:00:59,173
That seems fair;
we did just give you

26
00:00:59,171 --> 00:01:01,041
(Sheldon:)the painting.

